## Personal: Arc of Noah retelling

Billionaire uses AI to predict future; ends up “predicting” the end of the world\. Builds Arc &#40;bunker&#41;\. In this story the IA becomes the god that decides to wipe the world\.

Instead of leaving it up to chance, or having to wait for the “inevitable,” the billionaire and the IA decide to accelerate the end of the world\. The billionaire believes that he has the power and obligation to make sure to clean humanity’s sins and produce a new lineage that will be better \+ pure\.

He tasks the IA to build the bunker and everything in order to preserve the human race\.

Bait and switch: the day comes and they bring the end of the world but he “stays” behind\. The god AI determines that he and his family are not worth it &#40;they are as corrupt or more as the rest&#41;\. The AI picks someone else and his family to be saved instead of the billionaire\.
